%%{init: {'themeVariables': {'fontSize': 10}, 'flowchart': {'nodeSpacing': 8, 'rankSpacing': 12, 'diagramPadding': 2, 'curve': 'linear'}}}%%
graph LR
    %% C4 Context Level 1 - draw.io compatible
    %% People
    productEngineer[Product Engineer<br/><i>Person Role</i><br/>Approves promotions and baseline updates]
    productTeam[Product Team<br/><i>Person Role</i><br/>Maintains application code and runtime config]
    platformEngineer[Platform Engineer<br/><i>Person Role</i><br/>Maintains OS and image IaC baselines]
    securityAnalyst[Cyber Security Operations Analyst<br/><i>Person Role</i><br/>Monitors security and compliance evidence]

    %% System under design
    cicd[GitHub Organization App as Code CI/CD Platform<br/><i>Software System</i><br/>Automates build, policy gates, deployment, and compliance reporting]

    %% External systems
    appRepos[Application Repositories - GitHub<br/><i>External System</i><br/>Source repositories for application teams]
    infraRepos[Infrastructure Repositories - GitHub<br/><i>External System</i><br/>Source repositories for platform and IaC changes]
    aws[AWS Target Accounts<br/><i>External System</i><br/>Runtime environment for workload deployment]
    datadog[Datadog<br/><i>External System</i><br/>Central audit, security event, and dashboard platform]
    
    sn[ServiceNow - Phase 2<br/><i>External System</i><br/>Optional ITSM workflow and ticket integration]

    %% Relationships
    productEngineer -->|Approves promotions and baseline updates| cicd
    productTeam -->|Pushes app code and config| appRepos
    platformEngineer -->|Pushes OS and image IaC updates| infraRepos
    securityAnalyst -->|Reviews compliance and audit posture| cicd
    appRepos -->|Webhook trigger for GitHub Actions| cicd
    infraRepos -->|Webhook trigger for GitHub Actions| cicd
    cicd -->|OIDC federated deploy and baseline publish| aws
    cicd -->|Streams audit and security events| datadog
    
    cicd -.->|Optional change and remediation ticket sync| sn
    sn -.->|Optional IntegrationHub run trigger| cicd
    sn -.->|Optional remediation notice to product teams| productTeam

    %% Styling
    style cicd fill:#1168BD,color:#ffffff,stroke:#0b4884
    style productEngineer fill:#08427B,color:#ffffff,stroke:#052E56
    style productTeam fill:#08427B,color:#ffffff,stroke:#052E56
    style platformEngineer fill:#08427B,color:#ffffff,stroke:#052E56
    style securityAnalyst fill:#08427B,color:#ffffff,stroke:#052E56
    style appRepos fill:#999999,color:#ffffff,stroke:#666666
    style infraRepos fill:#999999,color:#ffffff,stroke:#666666
    style aws fill:#999999,color:#ffffff,stroke:#666666
    style datadog fill:#999999,color:#ffffff,stroke:#666666
    
    style sn fill:#999999,color:#ffffff,stroke:#666666
